{ "timestamp":"2026-07-29T16:34:38Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"2vw22", "Message":"Yeah or collect things and open a static depot somewhere.  I go to the bubble maybe once a year but make credits regardless", "Channel":"starsystem" }
